// GridSim web app: settings layered on top of appsettings.json when ASPNETCORE_ENVIRONMENT=Production (the container
// image and the systemd unit in docs/developer/deploy set it).
//
// F05: a production deployment starts REPLAY-ONLY. The solve REST API (/api/*) and the simulation WebSocket
// (/ws/sim) drive the in-process solver and have no authorisation, rate limit or cancellation yet (register item
// F14), so they are not exposed unless an operator deliberately turns them on with GridSim__ReplayOnly=false on a
// trusted network. Single sign-on stays off unless configured (see appsettings.json).
{
  "GridSim": {
    "ReplayOnly": true
  },
  "Sso": {
    "Enabled": false,
    "Authority": ""
  }
}
